{"event_type":"review","id":"bdf38e09051e9d759fa3f72e7f482a0b772aedd4b399bd7fe0a23a6bd1c4cb98","occurred_at":"2026-11-05T02:52:53Z","payload":{"artifacts":[{"location":"/home/ctaylor/.local/share/crq-backfill/artifacts/sha256/caf0ce383c192a953582b2337f4a25ae0c43e05f3b47b309218fadb48a1d6e2a","sha256":"caf0ce383c192a953582b2337f4a25ae0c43e05f3b47b309218fadb48a1d6e2a"},{"location":"/home/ctaylor/.local/share/crq-backfill/artifacts/sha256/04a63b4656bb0810d6dbc4185e24dca2e3ac6fd2712afa077a635a56f041f4a3","sha256":"04a63b4656bb0810d6dbc4185e24dca2e3ac6fd2712afa077a635a56f041f4a3"},{"kind":"git-bundle","location":"/home/ctaylor/.local/share/crq-backfill/artifacts/sha256/68c5cf626d3dcec65733db3edd2b96f16ba2c8d7d8d784f9f4dfed7b432cd11e","sha256":"68c5cf626d3dcec65733db3edd2b96f16ba2c8d7d8d784f9f4dfed7b432cd11e"},{"location":"/home/ctaylor/.local/share/crq-backfill/artifacts/sha256/9bef7f776bea7456456b39bdb764aa742968cdcfe6e5ce0d22423ca899b291ce","sha256":"9bef7f776bea7456456b39bdb764aa742968cdcfe6e5ce0d22423ca899b291ce"},{"location":"/home/ctaylor/.local/share/crq-backfill/artifacts/sha256/e30ff98a70bd1ef47819b0ba74259e3c32a081d96526fc7b9a2fc9bd3c6f6728","sha256":"e30ff98a70bd1ef47819b0ba74259e3c32a081d96526fc7b9a2fc9bd3c6f6728"}],"attempt_id":"5c80e7dd5df4b6a95b6dbabe106d76a84aa55bf3740d07244990eb87f4ed4377:0:1","base":"4649306a96f42f0f4b063597c0af7ecbf4cdc616","completion":{"errors":[],"exit_code":0,"scope_verified":true,"skipped":false,"terminal":true},"findings":[{"anchor_status":"unverified","blob":"0f584207e47ee104a2cc806443b673bb7bc41497","body":"**Set a deadline for bundle input.**\n\nIf an SSH client sends a short bundle and keeps stdin open, `read(64 * 1024 * 1024 + 1)` waits for more data or EOF. The 330-second socket timeout does not apply yet. Repeated stalled uploads can retain SSH sessions and Python processes indefinitely. Reject uploads that exceed an input deadline. (`apps/crq-python/signer/spool-shell:21`)","id":"37965173ddc84af6a127e9aa5756a24fa9105398655301d1cae314a1bfe799d2","intervals":[],"path":"apps/crq-python/signer/spool-shell","severity":"major","source_id":null,"status":"untriaged","title":"Set a deadline for bundle input."},{"anchor_status":"unverified","blob":"0eebbe5340f8e3b5759c2af1c8273e9e20dc062a","body":"**Document the forced-command transport setup.**\n\n`HOST-DEPLOY.md:37-40` only points to this guide. Neither guide explains where to install `spool-shell` or how the dedicated SSH key invokes `spool-shell ledger-only`. `crq.py` sends `ledger-publish`, but `spool-shell` rejects that command unless it runs with the `ledger-only` argument. Add the install path, ownership, and `authorized_keys` entry, or link to the owner-approved procedure.","id":"b82e24f5f2161452e8982a1a4fc2e872cec2b9acec5282b576327994a8ae07e1","intervals":[],"path":"apps/crq-python/signer/DEPLOY.md","severity":"minor","source_id":null,"status":"untriaged","title":"Document the forced-command transport setup."},{"anchor_status":"unverified","blob":"0f584207e47ee104a2cc806443b673bb7bc41497","body":"**Add a deadline to the bundle read.**\n\nLine 21 calls `sys.stdin.buffer.read(64 * 1024 * 1024 + 1)`. This call blocks until it receives 64 MiB + 1 bytes or EOF. The `connection.settimeout(330)` call on line 25 applies only to the ledger socket, and it runs after this read. A client that sends a short bundle and keeps stdin open holds the read, and the forced-command process, until it closes stdin or the SSH session ends by another means. Repeated stalled uploads can accumulate these processes.\n\nPut a total deadline on bundle input. Reject input that does not complete before the deadline, and keep the existing size checks.","id":"8ffaf16c31168ac49f827e97618037748e06a69f0a8225a150e323d56bc7b344","intervals":[],"path":"apps/crq-python/signer/spool-shell","severity":"minor","source_id":null,"status":"untriaged","title":"Add a deadline to the bundle read."}],"head":"1afc43ecc1119291a69ba9374a659b10b2013836","head_tree":"caf2bd1c0f6a76b490442f34307539ee3268e814","input_scope":[{"blob":"0eebbe5340f8e3b5759c2af1c8273e9e20dc062a","intervals":[[1,12]],"path":"apps/crq-python/signer/DEPLOY.md"},{"blob":"0f584207e47ee104a2cc806443b673bb7bc41497","intervals":[[1,42]],"path":"apps/crq-python/signer/spool-shell"}],"job_id":"5c80e7dd5df4b6a95b6dbabe106d76a84aa55bf3740d07244990eb87f4ed4377:0","outcome":"completed","paths":[{"baseline":{"method":"projection","reason":"path cluster"},"blob":"0eebbe5340f8e3b5759c2af1c8273e9e20dc062a","disposition":"included","mode":"100644","path":"apps/crq-python/signer/DEPLOY.md","reason":"bounded verified input"},{"baseline":{"method":"projection","reason":"path cluster"},"blob":"0f584207e47ee104a2cc806443b673bb7bc41497","disposition":"included","mode":"100644","path":"apps/crq-python/signer/spool-shell","reason":"bounded verified input"}],"policy_digest":"eacd1bcf42a0e72eca72fcf9c1e9c8f97e7c515cd67a8fa7965c966924647693","repo":"camerontaylor/cq-toolkit","requested_scope":[{"blob":"0eebbe5340f8e3b5759c2af1c8273e9e20dc062a","intervals":[[1,1],[3,12]],"path":"apps/crq-python/signer/DEPLOY.md"},{"blob":"0f584207e47ee104a2cc806443b673bb7bc41497","intervals":[[16,16]],"path":"apps/crq-python/signer/spool-shell"}],"reviewed_scope":[{"blob":"0eebbe5340f8e3b5759c2af1c8273e9e20dc062a","intervals":[[1,1],[3,12]],"path":"apps/crq-python/signer/DEPLOY.md"},{"blob":"0f584207e47ee104a2cc806443b673bb7bc41497","intervals":[[16,16]],"path":"apps/crq-python/signer/spool-shell"}],"scope_digest":"eeb4c7a4e301d04fdb4aedbec749fe05deea75633061acde45e14e7b0a9f52a5","source":{"authenticated":true,"id":"backfill-5c80e7dd5df4b6a95b6dbabe106d76a84aa55bf3740d07244990eb87f4ed4377-g0-20261105T024905Z","producer":"crq-runner-app","repo":"camerontaylor/cq-toolkit","type":"crq-run"},"subject_id":"5c80e7dd5df4b6a95b6dbabe106d76a84aa55bf3740d07244990eb87f4ed4377","target":"7a79296bbb91827e25888d9d6657667e635f98b9","target_tree":"caf2bd1c0f6a76b490442f34307539ee3268e814"},"schema":"cq.review-ledger/v1","source_key":"c